            "title": "Bascom Teens Reach Meeting: Canned Food Drive",
            "description": "<p><strong>Teens 13-18 are invited to the Bascom Teens Reach Canned Food Drive!</strong></p>\n<p><strong>Bring canned food to be donated to the needy through Second Harvest of Silicon Valley. No more than ten (10) cans per person, please. Refreshments will be available!</strong></p><p>Teens are invited to join Bascom Library Teens Reach in-person every 3rd Tuesday of the month! This program features fun&nbsp;volunteer opportunities,&nbsp;craft activities, games, and&nbsp;chances to hang out with your peers and learn new skills and information.<br><br>To join Teens Reach you must be 13-18 years of age, have a strong interest in the library, enjoy working with people of all ages and cultures, and be willing to learn new skills. Membership requires regular attendance at meetings, participation in and support of library activities and events, and a sense of fun and adventure. As a bonus, Teens Reach members can earn community service hours through participation in meetings and activities.<br></p>\n<p>For more information go to: <a href=\"https://www.sjpl.org/teensReach\">www.SJPL.org/teensReach</a><br><br>For ages 13-18. Held in Group Study Room 2.<br></p>\n<p><strong>Registration recommended but not required.</strong><br><br><a href=\"https://www.sjpl.org/ada-event-accommodation/\">ADA Accommodation Requests</a><br></p>",
